<div>
<p>
  The latest iteration of our vehicle, SeaWolf IX, was created with the goal of improving platform stability and consistency to enable future development work. This iteration drew from the lessons learned from previous iterations, and focuses on simplicity and maintainability throughout the design. SWIX's systems are divided into <b>Mechanical</b>, <b>Electrical</b>, and <b>Software</b> subgroups.
</p>
</div>

{% set itemList = collections.SWIXElectricalDetailsCollection %}

  <div class="full | region">
    <div class="wrapper flow prose">
      <h2>Electrical</h2>
      <p>SeaWolf IX uses a modular electrical architecture built around custom PCBs for power management, onboard logic, and locomotion control. This design keeps the system organized, expandable, and easier to maintain as new capabilities are added to the vehicle.</p>
      {% image "/assets/images/electrical/swix_electrical_arch.png", "SeaWolf IX Electrical Architecture Diagram" %}
      {% include 'partials/details.njk' %}
    </div>
  </div>

{% set itemList = collections.SWIXMechanicalDetailsCollection %}

  <div class="full | region">
    <div class="wrapper flow prose">
      <h2>Mechanical</h2>
      <p>SeaWolf's Mechanical systems include <b>a Type II Anodized Fully Modular Frame</b> equipped with <b>Buoyancy Control Boxes</b> and <b>Custom Camera Hulls</b>, creating an adaptable platform for future peripheral attachments.</p>
      {% include 'partials/details.njk' %}
    </div>
  </div>

  {% set itemList = collections.SWIXSoftwareDetailsCollection %}

  <div class="full | region">
    <div class="wrapper flow prose">
      <h2>Software</h2>
      <p>SeaWolf IX's software architecture builds on our previous <b>Rust</b> based core system while integrating <b>ROS2</b> and advanced logging with <b>Rerun.</b> SWIX's sensing capabilites are greatly improved, new featuring a forward facing <b>Stereo Depth Camera.</b></p>
      {% svg "misc/sw_arch_min", null, "sponsor-logo"%}
